mb|2H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I agree that 2@H is the best call. But at favorable vulnerability (you are not vulnerable, they are vulnerable) you should be particularly aggressive in preempting. With 6-4 distribution and 3 honors in hearts, 3@H would not be out of the question either.|
