mb|P|mb|3H|mb|D|mb|P|mb|3S|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|4H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|4@H by North is a slam try here, and tends to show a heart control. I obviously have a terrible hand and would not be interested in slam.|
