nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BA Kib: ^*NWhat is a good lead from AKx?|
PG| ***** 27 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|For those of us who have been playing bridge for 30+ years it used to be you led K from AK and KQ both and I actually still play that.|
PG| ***** 28 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|But these days the standard lead from AK or from AKx is the A as West correctly did. And the Q from AKQ. If you want to play K from AK (as I do) that is fine, you just have to agree.|
