mb|1C|mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|mb|1N|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|P|mb|2H|mb|P|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is not clear I should bid 2@S. But unless partner has 4 hearts (possible) they have an 8 card fit and I don't want to let them play at the 2 level with an 8 card fit. So I take a risk bidding 2@S even though my @HK is now very dubious.|
